{"id":10000062,"name":"埃洛伊","enName":"Aloy","title":"「异界的救世主」","element":"冰","region":"其他/异邦","rarity":5,"weapon":"弓","birthday":"4月4日","constellation":"诺拉勇者座","description":"曾经是流放者，如今则是无比机敏的猎手。随时准备着为了正当之事而挽弓放箭。","affiliation":"游侠","cv":{"chinese":"沐霏","japanese":"高垣彩阳","english":"——","korean":"赵玄正"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000062-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000062-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/11-500/Aloy.zip","voicePackageEn":"Aloy","quoteCount":57,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"我是埃洛伊，虽然对这个世界还不太了解，但我的弓和箭随时为你所用。如果你的队伍需要我，我会倾力相助。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/eaxzp9xor3qdiy2dip039k2hzesxuwi.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·动身","desc":"别闲站着了，该动身了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/4u4g866huozr5x3zm4kmoba258z153y.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·帮助","desc":"现在不该停留，还有人需要我们帮助。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/py7819tlee51tvxnahunb0xbcwtd9gq.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"雨，可以洗净脏污。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e6/endy4jigam2qvnw9xzkg6oprh872yco.mp3"},{"title":"雨过天晴…","desc":"雨停了，该把自己晾一晾了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_weather_afterRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6c/al2tw6l48glderkk4ss3poemv2f2l5j.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"下雪时，似乎整个世界都静下来了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/97wa4dcd0siowzpg3f3lh3bwjys7xc4.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"又起风了，在风中呼吸的感觉真不错。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_weather_breezy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a7/bq19piztd8xuibgxhjo5bbjdz9ue52j.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"风烈起来了，刮得脸上生疼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/i2lhz95e9dddrvv4gaz3skq2idbavri.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好。世界又充满了活力，我也一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/bafnhxilq6uo4dq36yftfiux2fw9fmy.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"日已过半，我们还有不少事要忙。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a4/l9y3j8qr7nzokuwqihruo7l8aucwswd.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"太阳落山了，再过不久星星就要出来了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/ch2kr2npar1z7rvzqwby7chn2hsw1i9.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"晚上好。该休息了，除非你想借着星光继续行动。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8e/tg9vw1z7r8yrk0kfycvhwm4ba92m3q6.mp3"},{"title":"关于埃洛伊自己…","desc":"我从小就是个流放者，那段日子很不好过。但在这里，即便是对待我这样的外人，大家也比我所降生的那个部落友好的多。感觉…很好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/jboyig8272hbat8dkrji89tk85jm5en.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·行动","desc":"我的一切行动都是为了拯救生命，而非带来死亡。这就是我与你并肩战斗的原因。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/00/0fh7vqswohnw2yxl9tedfc6k70bsjbo.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·誓约","desc":"立誓什么的，有点太循规蹈矩了。不过如果你想要我的誓约，那我的誓言与你同在。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/pwnrpw8s533rwzkht5h15vmy4y02rkm.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·前进","desc":"我会尽全力与你一起前进，直到终点。我不会踌躇，也不会辜负。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_close2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/46/pxvsf6a705gs1o49gdh1318lz0joocc.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"如果说有什么可以分享的话，那一定是我的弓与箭，我只为扶助他人而使用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/08wgko1i67aqqltqe4r21gltmo8d5x9.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"和我那边的世界一样，这片天地的过去也充满了秘密。如果能有足够的时间，我一定要把一切秘密都揭开。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_pref_gift","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2f/0ig9uc4ljy0ryqcvk0plv0c1tzbm35j.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解埃洛伊·其一","desc":"我不太擅长谈论自己的事情，眼下的任务才是重点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f8/k3qipxc3e6pwokmb8compbz3h5sufzj.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解埃洛伊·其二","desc":"我没有父母，是一个叫罗斯特的男人抚养我长大的。他有点严厉，不过心肠很好，也很大方。他教了我很多东西，嗯…我很想他。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/8jw7c85ixdj6e79b5petqrcgisjdimd.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解埃洛伊·其三","desc":"以前，我花了很多时间在寻找我的生母，却没能找到「她」。取而代之的是，我找到了一些远古的留言，是我的…「克隆母体」留下的。听着那些留言，我觉得她似乎很了解我，也很会鼓励我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/7h66l9sdsob5snp34mpczvfql2fgfb3.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解埃洛伊·其四","desc":"在成长的过程中，我没有什么朋友。虽然后来在旅途中认识了一些人，但当我离开那个世界时，我和他们的关系还称不上熟络。所以，能和你一同度过这么多时间，成为朋友，我真的很开心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/4ktbzhhpndzfvfikr3n16eb9zt504p9.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解埃洛伊·其五","desc":"我不会轻易信任他人，但我确定你是可以信任的。你是我真正的伙伴，我可不经常这样评价别人。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7a/col8twf4dki01th12isjuhajomkafwi.mp3"},{"title":"埃洛伊的爱好…","desc":"我不太清楚自己有什么爱好，「阅读古物」算一个吧。嗯，那就…历史？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f1/i6twufnhybhc6kyl2lh2ssiu97dyt1v.mp3"},{"title":"埃洛伊的烦恼…","desc":"除了我自己的世界，现在又多了一个世界需要拯救。唔…时间总是不够用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/qnaxp0u2k0ovn3hmlxftl01o0cjt005.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"我不挑食。只要不饿着肚子旅行，吃什么都行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_pref_foodLike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c0/d0bd66ja2fvt2zvooxqz65ds4kctj11.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"我吃过一次「奥斯拉姆炖肉」，稠得都能当沥青铺路了，呕。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/pja10roaytvpb1s4b3is8ge2tfz0q96.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"我从来不怎么在意生日。在我出生的世界，大家都会纪念母亲，没人庆祝自己的生日。不过先不管那些。嗯…祝你生日快乐。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_pref_birthday","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/4fy0pj4rgehvauu342phjqs54r1in6f.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"很好，咱们进展不错。但可不能止步于此。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/07/nswdp6xc05kwoyjdwu4danp75vovalf.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"有所成长，变得更强了，是件好事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d4/eycm5qhps96xgv00ptjqeolpy9xajlt.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"无论现在是多精湛的猎手，总还能更进一步。不要因为自满而止步，不要停止学习。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/a9oaw5vjlc1joem68o2z804nn8dme7d.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"我们刚开始搭伴旅行时，对我而言，你还只是一个陌生人，来自我所不熟悉的世界。但既然如今我们已经一同经历了这么多，我可以向你保证：我的弓永远与你同在。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/1ynbifewrj9dlgkj5iv3la6ngabs1pp.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"这玩意是会炸的。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/8crlsxrnyesioag7cvqs2dig97h7cdb.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"猎手的小玩具。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/8bqk7m7wxap2pmgg48qn5f2xqbg9m9b.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"见过这个吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/03/lbqttwr33vcazhrwmeckbd6q5j7uoso.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"禁锢！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/f6dis7l6m6hfwcylrq75dryebvqbj7l.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"一点新技巧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/69/rnp1nd5pwl4tljo5ixedfzcksembsgg.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"这里是我的猎场！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/t4ibo0o7fu8ytkttimysodwwi9ezz5u.mp3"},{"title":"打开风之翼·其一","desc":"这玩意用着还不错。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_explore_fly_start_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/e91iao0ap0tm361omyqfnfsadkwtget.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"嗯…算是些有用的东西。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/29/1w9hze3nj2zhbfamvdgw39zv1kuepar.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"这些能吃…这些能用…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5d/kjldfiwafqlqagxn4z6crgyzcz333qj.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"这些，到底是谁留在这的呢…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/m1s05snuzztsweo5mhehjlyahg3nys1.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"棘手的猎物…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3d/2bhic53a7s6vtkufhhehjz5o66mm41e.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"弱点在哪…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bb/h7acz5xt5azcexge39lgz0my0sj00ul.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"大意了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/10/kcu5pah2by5ci9m4q35j0uka6i8cwo1.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"当心！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/46g1iydt399o3573jrd13zjedv73gu2.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"别太冒进！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/czky3s8gn95pnx3heiq29gnv3nphazn.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"哪里…出了错…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/8maj9n2l50svasz0ogzx3t7n3lg5dtj.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"抱歉…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/e1uetyjmupnapvv5dom96n8krn4d505.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"失败的狩猎…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/qhtehhya2o2skj64x884y4jeqdiv5er.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"唔…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_hit_L_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3c/ktj9t27h1bdtisyl4jwek0ifu7hs1c3.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其二","desc":"小问题…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/44/8rzxu46nxerc6o6jtiaofwhq91dpdor.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"呃！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/8j6q69xx9iyylo2z9hwr8eedld8uett.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"有点麻烦…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_aloy/vo_aloy_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/nl7qbfe4l4r01r1ozybe2g5njgp43nl.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"这次要去哪转转？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_aloy_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2c/gg64s34l3f6qz7yh455s8r4ohxdwvyk.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"埃洛伊，加入狩猎。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_aloy_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/4q02ubd7uc9ye1s7dqh1cv3luio5mnx.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"需要帮手吗？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_aloy_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/76/pppmye8vfahfs2rh4otlaipt4a7hsgj.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000062-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000062-full.webp","fullArtWidth":906,"fullArtHeight":931}